Screenshots_04.png", "id": "720210893537540", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031399_720210896870873_1607751032437242072_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xdRw7q8SfsUQ7kNvwGNYp8e&_nc_oc=AdqTEjpytzcpCU1k838_OXg8BMH0LIvD9zp5FelU3LaXdtbUjw0dPPBK5zPCbj1ZVXE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0dtlHS02D4RPN6lTgTywmM6RytwRq_hKb2v-8Jpz_86w&oe=69F1FD2C"}, {"file_name": "Undercover_Screenshots_05.png", "id": "743045670695496", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974602_743045674028829_4316921965278868238_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PurP0m_OdjUQ7kNvwEcZW8e&_nc_oc=AdoJuWjb7KUKf39Ujw5CtV2vnO-y6XpbI2OCaL0L1KJ814AQVfwI2e9B9x2oM3Js2Hc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1o3E7-khxOTrii-Ul3KdwFH0XM1KqIyDSWV0IWJu-qNw&oe=69F1EA46"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Undercover_MRUpdate_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "373812651999851", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86655527_373812658666517_8384652531129662568_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fT3MygCAsQIQ7kNvwE3XNZM&_nc_oc=AdqTduyd3AcFFHRciytJ1icw0khVhbEaPOySF5Fp5d3hq-JIl8QHFn5EwutpmE3_Xr4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2Iy4eF5TETf37ntwSY7L4FAP7ymscuUfFz3MC3zbsffg&oe=69F209DC"}, "display_name": "Under Cover", "keywords": ["FPS", "arcade", "action", "guns", "shooter"], "long_description": "Under Cover: a Lightgun Cover Shooter inspired by arcade classics.\nDuck to reload with the groundbreaking Active Cover System. Rack up solo or co-op high scores as Red-Eye or Magnum - two undercover agents too cool to stay undercover - in the action-packed buddy-cop campaign.\n\nYour mission: infiltrate evil megacorp Infinidyne, take down CEO Pax Harrison, and shut down his mind-control technology before he turns billions into cybernetic meat puppets.\n\n\u2022 Classic lightgun arcade action, made for VR.\n\u2022 Take on Infinidyne solo with an AI partner or co-op with an online friend.\n\u2022 Reload and dodge enemy fire like an action hero with the Active Cover System.\n\u2022 Over-the-top cinematic action with explosions, bullet time, and environmental destruction.\n\u2022 Retro score system rewards aim, speed, and chained kills.\n\u2022 Use your skills, the environment, and a wide variety of special weapons to take out goons, advanced enemies, and Infinidyne bosses.\n\nAre you ready to go Under Cover?", "short_description": "Under Cover: a Lightgun Cover Shooter inspired by arcade classics.\n\nDuck to reload with the groundbreaking Active Cover System. Rack up solo or co-op high scores as Red-Eye or Magnum - two undercover agents too cool to stay undercover - in the action-packed buddy-cop campaign."}]}, "developer_name": "Sigtrap", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://coatsink.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Coatsink", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://coatsink.com/games/undercover", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "de", "es", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["CO_OP", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8705606369556700"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75495672_356912063641473_7422884051946341127_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat